OL,3,GNEWSA'Prominent' building may be used
OL,4,Aagain - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vacant building in Surrey could be
OL,7,Fbrought back into use, according to a
OL,8,Flocal authority.
OL,10,FElmbridge Borough Council said it is
OL,11,Fbringing forward plans to return the
OL,12,FOld Post Office building on Esher High
OL,13,FStreet to productive use.
OL,15,FIt added the plans could support "local
OL,16,Fbusinesses, jobs and town centre
OL,17,Factivity".
OL,19,FThe local authority said the property `
OL,20,Fwhich it described as "prominent" - had
OL,21,Fbeen disused since January 2025.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
